# Keep secrets, local environments, caches, tests and VCS data out of the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/venv
**/.venv*
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/test_*.py
**/conftest.py
**/tests
.git
.gitignore
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
helm
*.md
**/.DS_Store
